ri\u00e7\u00f5es?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es t\u00eam o valor de 14,00\u20ac para o Trail de 8 km, 12,00\u20ac para o Mini Trail de 4 km e 10,00\u20ac para a Caminhada de 2 km, com prazo de pagamento at\u00e9 segunda-feira, 14 de dezembro de 2026, \u00e0s 23:59.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o Bica Gin Urban Trail em Lavre?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 dinamizada pela Destilaria Monte da Bica (Bica Gin), sediada em Lavre, Montemor-o-Novo (contacto oficial da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o: 922 005 307).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como posso efetuar a minha inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o efetuadas online atrav\u00e9s da p\u00e1gina oficial do evento ligada no bot\u00e3o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o desta p\u00e1gina.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Bica Gin Urban Trail 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-19\", \"endDate\": \"2026-12-19\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"